Backport of grpc/grpc#42823 (06e470a02d64a597512951f9eadb3b607a315518).
https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/42823

Enable the fix unconditionally on gRPC 1.61.3: process buffered messages
before transport trailers and preserve cancellation and short-circuit semantics.

